"""Visually read DMD text from the retained Last Action Hero 1.12 (lah_112) service-test frames.

Every string below was read by a curator from the retained 128x32 frames (rendered at 4x) and checked
against the printed manual. The builder in ``build_lah_runtime_evidence.py`` pairs each reading with the
frame's pixel digest from the retained raw run, so a changed frame no longer matches its reading. A reading
is a curator's transcription, not an OCR result. The ROM spells the orange wire ``ORG`` where the manual's
charts print ``ORN``; the readings keep the ROM's spelling.
"""
